{%- comment -%}
  icon-tag — an outlined price tag in the current text colour, for the kit
  page's White Friday block. The same shape as the tag on the cart drawer's discount
  rows (ICON_TAG in snippets/cart-drawer.liquid, which draws its rows in
  script). Decorative: the words beside it say it. Output stays on one line.
  Params:
    classes — sizing/layout classes. Default 'size-4 shrink-0'.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign tag_classes = classes | default: 'size-4 shrink-0' -%}
